%% Competing data-changing requests for the same space and period
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Driver A app
    participant B as Driver B app
    participant S as Web service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    par nearly simultaneous
        A->>S: POST /reservations space A-01 10:00-12:00 (op-A)
    and
        B->>S: POST /reservations space A-01 11:00-13:00 (op-B)
    end
    S->>DB: TX A: insert reservation HELD
    S->>DB: TX B: insert reservation HELD
    DB-->>S: TX A committed
    DB-->>S: TX B exclusion_violation (period overlaps)
    S->>DB: store op-B as REJECTED 409
    S-->>A: 201 HELD, holdExpiresAt 10:12
    S-->>B: 409 SPACE_UNAVAILABLE + alternative free spaces
    Note over B: B retries op-B -> same 409 replayed, no new attempt
